{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>GIF Aura 是一款集合 GIF 製作、編輯與格式轉換的 App，適合喜愛自製動態表情、反應圖與 Live Photo 的用家，亦方便需要把影片、相片快速轉成動態內容的創作者。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>本機處理的 GIF 工具箱</h2>\n<p>GIF Aura 將常見的 GIF 製作、編輯與轉換工具集合於一身，可把自拍影片變成動態表情，或將多張相片、影片剪輯、Live Photo 合成動態 GIF，亦能把 GIF 轉回 Live Photo 或影片。內置文字 GIF、貼紙註解、濾鏡、裁剪、縮放、合併、倒播、分解畫格與壓縮等功能，全部在本機完成，毋須註冊、沒有廣告與水印，並支援多種語言。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-246-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-247-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-248-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-249-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-250-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-251-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：GIF Aura</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:06:39.988993+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":358,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}